-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PaddleOCR pre- and post-processing parameters

The pipeline's constants (input sizes, normalization, DB thresholds, unclip
ratio, reading-order tolerance, CTC decoding rules) follow the published
inference.yml of each model and the documented behaviour of PaddleOCR
(https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR, Apache License 2.0). The Go
implementation is this repository's own.

